---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { ownerLedTrust } from '@/data/interiorRenovationsPrototype';
---

<section class="proto-owner-trust section-anchor" id="why-strataline">
	<div class="proto-owner-trust__media reveal">
		<Image
			src={ownerLedTrust.image.src}
			alt={ownerLedTrust.image.alt}
			widths={[480, 720, 960, 1280]}
			sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 44vw"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
		<div class="proto-owner-trust__shade"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="proto-owner-trust__intro reveal">
		<p class="proto-eyebrow">Owner-led renovations</p>
		<h2>The person who scopes your project stays involved.</h2>
		<p class="proto-owner-trust__identity">
			<strong>Maxim Sologub</strong>
			<span>Owner, Strataline Inc.</span>
			<small>Renovation contractor · GTA</small>
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="proto-owner-trust__copy reveal">
		<p>
			Strataline is owner-operated by Maxim Sologub, a renovation contractor with more than 15 years
			of hands-on experience across the GTA. Maxim personally assesses projects, develops the scope
			of work and remains directly involved through scheduling, coordination and quality control.
		</p>
		<p>
			Clients are not handed from a salesperson to an unfamiliar project team after the quote. The
			person who understands the project from the beginning remains involved as the work progresses.
		</p>
		<p class="proto-owner-trust__proof">
			Personally assessed <span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Clearly scoped
			<span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Owner involved <span aria-hidden="true">•</span> Quality controlled
		</p>
		<blockquote>
			<p>“{ownerLedTrust.quote}”</p>
			<cite>
				<strong>{ownerLedTrust.name}</strong>
				<span>{ownerLedTrust.location}</span>
			</cite>
		</blockquote>
	</div>
</section>
